Introduction
Virtual World Platform ("the Platform", "we", "our", or "us") is committed to protecting the privacy, security, and personal information of all users.

This Privacy Policy explains:

What information we collect
Why we collect it
How we use it
How we protect it
Your rights regarding your information
How age verification and age progression systems operate
By using the Platform, you acknowledge and agree to the practices described in this Privacy Policy.

Privacy Principles
The Platform is designed around the following privacy principles:

Data Minimization
We collect only the information necessary to operate the Platform.

Privacy by Design
Privacy considerations are incorporated into system architecture and product development.

Security
Reasonable technical and organizational safeguards are used to protect information.

Transparency
Users have the right to understand how their information is used.

User Control
Users may access, update, or request deletion of eligible information where permitted by law.

Information We Collect
Account Information
During registration, we may collect:

Username
Email Address
Date of Birth
Country
Encrypted Password Credentials
The Platform uses date of birth information to determine eligibility for age-based environments and future Age Progression System functionality.

Profile Information
Users may choose to provide:

Display Name
Avatar Appearance
Profile Description
Profile Images
Preferences
Profile information is visible according to user privacy settings.

Platform Activity Information
We collect information related to platform usage.

Examples include:

Login History
Session Information
Device Information
Housing Data
Inventory Data
Avatar Data
Social Interactions
Marketplace Activity
This information helps operate and secure platform services.

Communication Information
We may process communications occurring within Platform services.

Examples include:

Public Chat
Private Messages
Community Discussions
Marketplace Communications
Support Requests
Communications may be reviewed by automated safety systems and authorised moderation personnel for community safety and policy enforcement purposes.

Safety and Moderation Information
To protect users and maintain platform integrity, we may collect:

Reports
Moderation Actions
Account Restrictions
Appeal History
Safety Flags
Investigation Records
This information is used solely for trust and safety purposes.

Technical Information
The Platform may automatically collect technical information including:

IP Address
Device Type
Operating System
Application Version
Network Information
Crash Reports
Performance Metrics
This information supports security, reliability, and troubleshooting.

Age Verification Information
The Platform may use third-party age assurance or age verification services.

Where age verification is required, we seek to minimise collection of sensitive identity information.

Whenever possible, the Platform stores only:

Verification Status
Verified Date of Birth
Verification Date
Verification Expiration Date
Provider Reference ID
The Platform will seek to avoid retaining identity documents unless legally required or operationally necessary.

Age Progression System (APS)
The Platform includes a future Age Progression System that allows users to transition from Teen Environment access to Adult Environment access when they become eligible.

APS may process:

Date of Birth
Verification History
Eligibility Status
Realm Assignment
APS decisions are enforced through server-side systems and cannot be modified by users.

How We Use Information
We use personal information to:

Provide Platform Services
Authenticate Users
Enable Multiplayer Features
Store Housing Data
Manage Inventories
Facilitate Marketplace Transactions
Enforce Community Standards
Detect Abuse
Improve Platform Stability
Comply With Legal Obligations
We do not sell user personal information.

Safety Monitoring
To protect users, particularly minors, communications and activity may be analysed by automated safety systems.

Automated systems may assist with detection of:

Harassment
Threats
Fraud
Spam
Exploitation
Policy Violations
Automated systems assist human moderation but do not replace human judgement for significant enforcement actions.

Sharing Information
We may share information with:

Service Providers
Trusted providers assisting with:

Hosting
Cloud Storage
Authentication
Age Verification
Payment Processing
Security Services
Analytics
Service providers receive only information reasonably necessary to perform their functions.

Legal Compliance
Information may be disclosed when required:

By Law
By Court Order
To Comply With Legal Obligations
To Protect Users
To Investigate Serious Safety Concerns
Business Transactions
If the Platform undergoes:

Merger
Acquisition
Sale
Corporate Restructuring
user information may be transferred as part of the transaction subject to applicable laws.

Teen Environment Privacy
The Teen Environment operates with enhanced privacy protections.

Additional restrictions may include:

Limited Profile Visibility
Restricted Communication Features
Additional Safety Controls
Enhanced Moderation
Parent / Guardian Features
The Platform seeks to reduce unnecessary public exposure of information relating to minors.

Data Retention
Information is retained only for as long as necessary to:

Operate the Platform
Provide Services
Enforce Policies
Resolve Disputes
Meet Legal Obligations
Protect Users
Retention periods may vary depending on information type.

Account Deletion
Users may request account deletion where permitted by law.

Certain information may be retained for:

Fraud Prevention
Security
Legal Compliance
Safety Investigations
Financial Recordkeeping
Where retention is required, information will be restricted appropriately.

Security Measures
The Platform uses security measures designed to protect information, including:

Encryption In Transit
Encryption At Rest
Access Controls
Audit Logging
Role-Based Permissions
Monitoring Systems
Backup Systems
No system can guarantee absolute security; however, we strive to maintain strong protections for user information.

International Transfers
Your information may be stored or processed in jurisdictions outside your place of residence.

Where information is transferred internationally, reasonable safeguards will be implemented as appropriate.

User Rights
Subject to applicable laws, users may have rights to:

Access Personal Information
Correct Inaccurate Information
Request Deletion
Object To Certain Processing
Request Data Portability
Withdraw Certain Consents
Requests may require identity verification.

Children's Privacy
The Platform is designed to support age-appropriate experiences for eligible teenage users.

Additional safeguards may apply to accounts belonging to minors.

Users below the minimum permitted age for the Platform may not create accounts.

Third-Party Services
The Platform may integrate with third-party services including:

Authentication Providers
Age Verification Providers
Cloud Providers
Payment Processors
Analytics Services
Those providers may maintain separate privacy policies governing their own processing activities.

Policy Updates
This Privacy Policy may be updated periodically.

Material changes may be communicated through:

Website Notices
Application Notices
Email Notifications
Continued use of the Platform after updates may constitute acceptance of revised policies.

