Summary
The Virtual World Platform is built on four privacy commitments:

Collect only what is needed.
Protect user information.
Provide transparency and control.
Maintain enhanced protections for minors.
Our goal is to create a virtual world that allows users to socialize, create, and grow over time while respecting privacy, security, and age-appropriate safeguards.
